        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCHYD, Porcelain Hyde Park Knob with Arc Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hyde Park Knob with Arc Plate is made of the stunning combination of a white porcelain knob paired with a traditional arched rosette for an undeniable luxurious look. This Porcelain Hyde Park Knob with Arc Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Grandeur's Arc Short Plate is available in a wide variety of finish options, including oil rubbed bronze and polished brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCHYD Arc Rosette with Hyde Park Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Porcelain White Hyde Park Knobset with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCHYD-specifications.pdf?v=1704262390\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCHYD Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
