                "title": "Hyde Park Knob with Arc Plate",
                "description": "The Hyde Park Knob with Arc Plate is made of the stunning combination of a white porcelain knob paired with a traditional arched rosette for an undeniable luxurious look. This Porcelain Hyde Park Knob with Arc Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Grandeur's Arc Short Plate is available in a wide variety of finish options, including oil rubbed bronze and polished brass.",
